yset\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{2}=\\{&lt;\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\n\\bigl(n\\neq2\\to\\mathrm{Rel}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{n}=\\emptyset\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Language}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ArithForm}=\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>等号属于固定逻辑符号集，故不作为非逻辑签名分量重复列出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf s\">\\(\\mathsf s\\)</span>是对象语言的一元函数符号；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f63c32733077b50\" href=\"?note=0f63c32733077b50\" title=\"88-df-successor-function\">88-df-successor-function</a>中的\n数值函数将在语义解释后与它关联，二者不再在句法层混同。</li>\n<li>算术公式定义算术集合</li>\n<li>算术公式是不完备性的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ (arithmetic signature, see [[88-df-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-5"